You slumped in your seat.

Salem: "Thank you, I made it."

She scooped some onto her spoon.

Then held it out to you.

Salem: "Come on, open your mouth."

You hesitated, then complied.

The flavor burst across your tongue.

You: "Thank you..."

Salem: "..."

She only smiled.

