title: Salem4
---
This time when you visited the cafe, Salem sat in her usual corner.

Her lunch was laid out with small, sweet snacks.

She looked up at you, smiling brightly.

She gestured to the seat in front of her.

Salem: "{$playerName}!"

Salem: "You always come at the same time, that's good."

You watched her hands reach into your bag.

You: "Why's that?"

Your answer came when she pulled out a premade lunch.

She pushed it toward you.

She smiled bashfully while you opened it.

The food smelled amazing.

Your mouth watered.

Salem: "I... made this for you."

Her voice rose into a soft squeak.

You smiled and took a fork.

Salem: "So, how was your day?"

